<view class="page">
  <view class="notice">
    提交招募信息后，由店主在「服务人员」里审核。审核通过后，请让技师用手机号在技师端绑定即可接单；同一手机号只能建档一次。
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{!submitted}}">
    <view class="card form">
      <view class="field">
        <text class="label">姓名</text>
        <input
          class="input"
          placeholder="技师姓名"
          value="{{form.name}}"
          data-field="name"
          maxlength="60"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <text class="label">手机号</text>
        <input
          class="input"
          type="number"
          placeholder="用于登录技师端"
          value="{{form.phone}}"
          data-field="phone"
          maxlength="11"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <text class="label">服务城市</text>
        <input
          class="input"
          placeholder="如：上海市 / 杭州市（可留空）"
          value="{{form.city}}"
          data-field="city"
          maxlength="60"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <text class="label">技能介绍</text>
        <textarea
          class="textarea"
          placeholder="擅长项目、从业年限等（可留空）"
          value="{{form.intro}}"
          data-field="intro"
          maxlength="2000"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="error" wx:if="{{errorText}}">{{errorText}}</view>

    <button class="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">
      提交招募
    </button>
  </block>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card done">
      <view class="done-title">已提交</view>
      <view class="muted">{{resultText}}</view>
      <button class="submit ghost" bindtap="restart">继续招募下一位</button>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
